Step 9: frontend pages (Section 8 + Addendum v1.1 UI)

UI primitives: Button, Badge (Status/Severity), ScoreGauge (SVG arc),
State (Spinner/Error/Empty/StateView/PageHeader), Modal/Field; useApi
hook (loading/error/reload).

Pages, each with loading/error/empty/populated states:
- Dashboard: summary cards, sites table with gauge + Audit Now,
  recent audits, needs-attention panel
- Sites: search, add-site modal, view/delete actions
- Site Detail: recharts score-trend line, category bars, audit
  history, trigger audit + 3s status polling
- Audit Report: overall gauge, summary stats, AI summary, quick-win
  cards, score breakdown, issues panel with severity tabs +
  expandable fixes, GSC panel, Addendum backlinks panel; polls
  /status every 3s while running
- API Tokens: table, create modal showing token once with copy,
  revoke, API usage/docs
- Settings: integration status cards incl. Addendum DataForSEO
- Compare (Addendum): 2-5 site selector, recharts grouped bars,
  category table with trophy leaders, gap cards, bookmarkable
  ?site_ids copy-link

npm run build passes: 8 routes, types valid, lint clean.

